Category: IT Services

Location: Fort Western Province Sri Lanka

For an international organization, we are urgently looking for a REMOTE Senior Java Developer/AWS specialist to assist with activities related to migration of existing Java/Oracle web-based applications to an AWS cloud environment.

During the corona crisis, interviews will be done through WEBEX, and travel is not required for the interviews. All positions are long-term.

Candidates need to be able to work the European schedule.

Tasks and deliverables

• Assist with the migration/configuration of web-based applications to an AWS cloud environment in accordance with established architectural standards and practices;

• Implement, manage, and support technical processes for deployment of infrastructure, automation of deployment and operations, and related practices;

• Complete the ongoing migration of the Madrid eFiling system to an AWS cloud environment;

• Enable Redis caching for applications that have been migrated to an AWS cloud environment to allow the removal of sticky sessions;

• Assist with the review/relocating/removal of a custom SSO authentication module;

• Review and write required additional web services;

• Document as needed;

Profile

• Bachelor/Master degree;

• +7 years of Java Development experience;

• Experience in migration of applications to AWS cloud-based infrastructure, including configuration and deployment;

• Proficient in developing front-end and back-end solutions for modern web applications using Java EE, JSF, and JavaScript frameworks;

• Experience with digital authentication mechanisms and frameworks;

• Hands-on experience in DevOps toolchain - Jira/Git/Bamboo;

• Excellent document production skills - design documents, architecture diagrams, transition plans;

• Fluent in English;

Essential tools:

• Cloud technologies (AWS);

• Java EE, Javascript, JSF, JSP, Spring, Hibernate;

• Web services: SOAP, REST;

• SSO authentication (OIDC / OpenAM);

• HTML, XML, CSS, Javascript;

• Database skills (RDBMS, redis caching);

• Microservice architectures;

Offered:

• A challenging role for an international organization;

• Attractive salary package or freelance rate;

Interested:

Please send your resume and motivation to or call us on +94 114312515 for more information.

